  "description": "A fluent, cache-aware SQLite persistence layer for .NET MAUI: a generic repository with Select / Insert / Update / Delete accessors, expression-to-SQL translation (projections, joins, grouping, aggregates) that keeps filters in the database rather than in memory, debounced in-memory caches for hot reference tables, ordered schema migrations, and consistent GUID-id handling for stores whose rows can arrive in any case. Application behaviour — audit fields, soft delete, tenancy, sync metadata, conflict policy, value converters — is injected through a configuration builder, entity descriptors, and an interceptor pipeline; the package knows nothing about your domain.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
